"Makee-en is a knight of the en family, the art'hs' neighbors, a few years older than Sina's set."
"Makee has a small nose, large very dark eyes and low, nearly straight brows."
"Makee tattles to Stu's family and represented the en family at DawnStep for nephew Nel-en."
"At the DawnStep oath ceremony Esh-erdi rescued Stu from Makee's attention."
